{
	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - User - MFA - Okta MFA Factor Deactivated, Suspended or Reset",
	"Description": "An MFA factor was deactivated, suspended, or reset. Any of the three leaves the account with less second-factor coverage than it had a moment ago; correlate with what signed in afterwards.\n\nEvent types: user.mfa.factor.deactivate, user.mfa.factor.suspend, user.mfa.factor.reset_all, user.mfa.factor.update\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/sigmahq/sigma/identity/okta/okta_mfa_reset_or_deactivated/\n- https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/identity/okta/okta_mfa_reset_or_deactivated.yml",
